    },
    {
      "id": "2119994631509467446",
      "text": "\"To my four beautiful children – Zack, Victoria, Noah, and Felix – I feel so lucky to be your dad. Watching you grow is a real gift. I hope you each chase your dreams...wherever life takes you, I'll always be here supporting you and cheering you on.\" -- Patrice Bergeron https://t.co/Kb8Ih6avJF",
      "url": "https://x.com/NHLBruins/status/2119994631509467446",
      "published": "2026-11-10T03:24:42+00:00",
      "likes": 719,
      "author": "Boston Bruins",
      "handle": "NHLBruins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2120592543909924864/kXR5gSZg_normal.jpg",
